  "details": "I understand that there was a change for UI elements when you have a parent pickup. In VR this makes sense so you cant press the UI from the same hand you are holding it in, but you can still use your other hand to interact.\n\nIn Desktop this also disables the UI interaction when you are holding the pickup and disables the ability to interact with the UI while holding TAB so you can move the mouse around over the menu. This is something I have made use of in Avi Wars since its release.",
